# Z-matrix (internal coordinates), generated along molecular-graph spanning tree
# Units: bond length in Å, angle/dihedral in degrees
# Format: index name | parent r=... | parent a=... | parent d=...
# Parent is an atom label (e.g. C2) or absolute reference (origin/e_z/e_x)

  2  C2     | origin  r=0.0000  | e_z     a=0.00  | e_x     d=-0.00
  1  N1     | C2      r=1.2600  | e_z     a=90.00  | e_x     d=90.00
  3  O3     | C2      r=1.8500  | N1      a=95.00  | e_x     d=-0.00
  5  H5     | C2      r=1.1040  | N1      a=120.00  | e_x     d=-180.00
  4  H4     | N1      r=1.3500  | C2      a=90.00  | O3      d=-0.00
  6  H6     | O3      r=0.9670  | C2      a=110.00  | N1      d=-180.00
